Package: AgrilusOakPreds
Title: Code Used to Infer Plant – Pest Interactions in Hernandez-Gutierrez et al. (2024)
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Code and analyses associated with the study by 
    Hernandez-Gutierrez et al. (2024) titled 
    "Combined phylogenetic and geographic data can predict plant–pest 
    interactions with high accuracy" 
    <https://doi.org/10.1101/2024.10.30.619026>.
